# P0-M4-R2 narrow validation -- local-only private artifacts.
# Selection/adapter/verifier SOURCE and sanitized (opaque-ID-only) evidence
# JSON ARE committed; anything that could contain owner audio, real local
# paths, blind keys, or the private corpus itself is NOT.

# Entire local working area: decoded/rendered audio, the NG4 owner
# annotation pack (clips + blind key + filled response template), and any
# other scratch output this task's scripts produce.
work_local/
work_local*/

# Belt-and-braces (root .gitignore already covers *.wav/*.flac/etc. and
# *.local.json is not a root pattern, so the private id_map/corpus files
# and this task's own blind_key.local.json/response_template are covered
# here explicitly too).
*.local.json
blind_key*.json
